sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant Config as Helidon Config
    participant Env as helidon-oci-envconfig
    participant Auth as OCI auth method SPI
    participant Registry as Service Registry
    participant Client as OCI client integration

    App->>Config: Load oci-config.yaml
    Config->>Env: Resolve region, AD, FD, domains
    App->>Auth: Select authentication-method
    Auth->>Auth: Try classpath methods when auto
    Auth->>Registry: Publish BasicAuthenticationDetailsProvider
    Client->>Registry: Inject provider and region services
    Client->>Client: Build service client with shared settings